:""},"say:9:1410314002:1":{"text":"フリンさん、ホーガンの持ち物からこれが……同族が作った物のようだ。","source_cn":"弗林，我们在霍根身上找到了这个，看起来也是我们的技术。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A908EF2218C8FE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:9::2":{"text":"魔法通信機","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410314003:1":{"text":"ふんっ、つまらんものを使いやがって。壊せ。","source_cn":"嗤，旁门左道的小玩意儿，销毁吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE1374D4ADA29C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410314004:0":{"text":"ホーガンの身柄は我々の「協力者」に引き渡せ。向こうで処理してくれるはずだ。","source_cn":"记得把霍根交给我们亲爱的合作伙伴，我相信他们会处理干净的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14076BDBD89D2D24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410314005:0":{"text":"けど、こいつは特使だろ……ブライトにどう説明すれば？","source_cn":"特使被我们……耀光那边能交代得了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5883934DBEAFF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410314006:0":{"text":"忘れたのか？俺たちの協力者は、地下の灰ネズミどもだけじゃないだろう。","source_cn":"别忘了，我们的合作伙伴可不止地底那群灰老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73452A8E991274F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410314007:0":{"text":"そろそろサバンナの方からも、何か見返りを期待していい頃だ。","source_cn":"赛凡纳的朋友也该回报点什么了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA801F5BC4319FAF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:14010322:0":{"text":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","source_cn":"矮人隆多拿来美酒，谁知酒里有毒，霍根喝下后晕了过去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA92D89384A2336","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","female":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","variant_male_record_index":"166551","variant_female_record_index":"166552","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:14010322:0":{"text":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","source_cn":"矮人隆多拿来美酒，谁知酒里有毒，霍根喝下后晕了过去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA92D89384A2336","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","female":"ロンドが差し出した美酒には、密かに毒が仕込まれていた。何も知らないホーガンはグラスを飲み干すと、その場で気を失った。","variant_male_record_index":"166551","variant_female_record_index":"166552","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗林":{"text":"フリン","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"ホーガン","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字